#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:10
msgid ""
"Ringkasan Perjanjian Pemrosesan Data (Data Processing Agreement) yang "
"mengikat setiap kontrak berlangganan EduCore, sesuai UU No. 27 Tahun 2022 "
"tentang Pelindungan Data Pribadi."
msgstr ""
"A summary of the Data Processing Agreement that is attached to every EduCore"
" subscription contract, per Law No. 27 of 2022 on Personal Data Protection."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:17
#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:28
msgid "Para pihak"
msgstr "The parties"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:18
#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:31
msgid "Ruang lingkup pemrosesan"
msgstr "Scope of processing"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:19
#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:40
msgid "Kewajiban EduCore sebagai pemroses"
msgstr "EduCore's obligations as processor"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:20
#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:43
msgid "Subpemroses pihak ketiga"
msgstr "Third-party subprocessors"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:21
#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:46
msgid "Hak yayasan sebagai pengendali"
msgstr "The foundation's rights as controller"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:22
#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:49
msgid "Pengakhiran & pengembalian data"
msgstr "Termination & data return"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:29
msgid ""
"Perjanjian ini berlaku antara yayasan/sekolah pelanggan (Pengendali Data) "
"dan PT Astra Digital Solusi, penyedia EduCore (Pemroses Data). Salinan yang "
"ditandatangani menjadi lampiran kontrak berlangganan setiap yayasan dan "
"mengikat secara hukum sejak tanggal aktivasi akun."
msgstr ""
"This agreement is between the customer foundation/school (Data Controller) "
"and PT Astra Digital Solusi, EduCore's provider (Data Processor). A signed "
"copy is attached to each foundation's subscription contract and is legally "
"binding from the account activation date."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:33
msgid "Aspek"
msgstr "Aspect"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:33
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:84
msgid "Ketentuan"
msgstr "Terms"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:34
msgid "Subjek data"
msgstr "Data subjects"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:34
msgid "Siswa, orang tua/wali, dan staf yayasan"
msgstr "Students, parents/guardians, and foundation staff"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:35
msgid ""
"Identitas, kehadiran, akademik, keuangan, kepegawaian, dan (opsional) "
"biometrik/kesehatan"
msgstr ""
"Identity, attendance, academic, financial, employment, and (optional) "
"biometric/health data"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:36
msgid "Tujuan"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:36
msgid ""
"Semata-mata untuk menjalankan layanan EduCore sesuai instruksi tertulis "
"yayasan"
msgstr ""
"Solely to operate the EduCore service per the foundation's written "
"instructions"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:37
msgid "Durasi"
msgstr "Duration"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:37
msgid ""
"Sepanjang masa berlangganan, ditambah periode retensi statutori yang berlaku"
msgstr ""
"For the duration of the subscription, plus the applicable statutory "
"retention period"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:41
msgid ""
"EduCore memproses data pribadi hanya berdasarkan instruksi terdokumentasi "
"dari yayasan, menjaga kerahasiaan data, menerapkan enkripsi TLS 1.3 saat "
"transit dan AES-256 saat tersimpan, membatasi akses staf internal secara "
"terbatas waktu dan teraudit, serta membantu yayasan memenuhi permintaan hak "
"subjek data dan kewajiban pelaporan insiden dalam waktu 3×24 jam sejak "
"insiden terdeteksi."
msgstr ""
"EduCore processes personal data only on the foundation's documented "
"instructions, keeps data confidential, applies TLS 1.3 encryption in transit"
" and AES-256 at rest, restricts internal staff access to time-boxed and "
"audited sessions, and helps the foundation fulfil data subject requests and "
"the 3×24-hour incident notification obligation from the moment an incident "
"is detected."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:44
msgid ""
"Daftar subpemroses (mis. penyedia infrastruktur cloud, gateway pembayaran, "
"penyedia WhatsApp Business API) dipublikasikan beserta tujuan dan lokasi "
"pemrosesannya. Penambahan subpemroses baru memerlukan penilaian dampak "
"pelindungan data (DPIA) terdokumentasi sebelum diaktifkan."
msgstr ""
"The list of subprocessors (e.g. cloud infrastructure providers, payment "
"gateways, the WhatsApp Business API provider) is published along with their "
"purpose and processing location. Adding a new subprocessor requires a "
"documented Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA) before it goes live."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:47
msgid ""
"Yayasan berhak meminta audit kepatuhan, salinan log akses ke data "
"pribadinya, dan bukti pemenuhan kewajiban keamanan. Yayasan tetap menjadi "
"satu-satunya pihak yang berwenang menginstruksikan perubahan tujuan "
"pemrosesan."
msgstr ""
"The foundation has the right to request a compliance audit, a copy of access"
" logs to its personal data, and evidence of security obligations being met. "
"The foundation remains the only party authorized to instruct changes to the "
"purpose of processing."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/dpa.html:50
msgid ""
"Saat kontrak berakhir, yayasan dapat meminta ekspor lengkap datanya. Data "
"dihapus dari sistem produksi setelah periode retensi statutori terpenuhi, "
"sebagaimana dijelaskan pada"
msgstr ""
"When the contract ends, the foundation can request a full export of its "
"data. Data is deleted from production systems once the statutory retention "
"period has been met, as described on"

