"Melewati batas menghasilkan <code>429 RATE_LIMITED</code> dengan header "
"<code>Retry-After</code>. Ekspor besar memakai endpoint job asinkron, bukan "
"paginasi beruntun."
msgstr ""
"Exceeding the limit produces a <code>429 RATE_LIMITED</code> with a "
"<code>Retry-After</code> header. Large exports use an async job endpoint, "
"not sequential pagination."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:4
msgid "Kebijakan Privasi — EduCore"
msgstr "Privacy Policy — EduCore"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:9
msgid "Kebijakan Privasi"
msgstr "Privacy Policy"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:10
msgid ""
"Berlaku untuk data yang diproses EduCore atas nama yayasan pendidikan yang "
"menggunakan platform ini, sesuai UU No. 27 Tahun 2022 tentang Pelindungan "
"Data Pribadi (UU PDP)."
msgstr ""
"Applies to data EduCore processes on behalf of the education foundations "
"using this platform, per Law No. 27 of 2022 on Personal Data Protection (UU "
"PDP)."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:17
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:29
msgid "Peran pengendali & pemroses"
msgstr "Controller & processor roles"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:18
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:32
msgid "Data yang dikumpulkan"
msgstr "Data collected"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:19
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:35
msgid "Dasar & tujuan pemrosesan"
msgstr "Legal basis & purpose of processing"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:20
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:38
msgid "Keamanan & lokasi data"
msgstr "Security & data location"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:21
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:41
msgid "Hak subjek data"
msgstr "Data subject rights"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:22
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:44
msgid "Data anak"
msgstr "Children's data"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:23
#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:47
msgid "Insiden kebocoran data"
msgstr "Data breach incidents"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:30
msgid ""
"Yayasan/sekolah adalah pengendali data (data controller) atas data siswa, "
"orang tua, dan staf yang dimasukkan ke EduCore. EduCore bertindak sebagai "
"pemroses data (data processor) yang memproses data tersebut hanya sesuai "
"instruksi tertulis yayasan, sebagaimana diatur dalam Perjanjian Pemrosesan "
"Data (DPA)."
msgstr ""
"The foundation/school is the data controller for student, parent, and staff "
"data entered into EduCore. EduCore acts as the data processor, processing "
"that data only per the foundation's written instructions, as set out in the "
"Data Processing Agreement (DPA)."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:33
msgid ""
"Bergantung pada modul yang diaktifkan yayasan, EduCore dapat memproses: "
"identitas siswa dan orang tua/wali (nama, NISN, NIK, tanggal lahir, alamat),"
" data kehadiran dan foto gerbang, template biometrik (opsional, dengan "
"persetujuan terpisah), data akademik dan rapor, data keuangan dan tagihan, "
"data kepegawaian dan jabatan staf, serta log komunikasi ke orang tua."
msgstr ""
"Depending on the modules a foundation enables, EduCore may process: student "
"and parent/guardian identity (name, NISN, NIK, date of birth, address), "
"attendance data and gate photos, biometric templates (optional, with "
"separate consent), academic and report card data, financial and billing "
"data, staff employment and role data, and logs of communication to parents."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:36
msgid ""
"Dasar hukum pemrosesan dicatat per tujuan (pelaksanaan layanan pendidikan, "
"kewajiban pelaporan ke pemerintah, atau persetujuan eksplisit untuk "
"biometrik, media, dan komunikasi pemasaran). Persetujuan diminta per tujuan "
"secara terpisah — tidak pernah digabung dalam satu persetujuan umum — dan "
"dicatat dengan versi serta waktu."
msgstr ""
"The legal basis for processing is recorded per purpose (delivering the "
"education service, government reporting obligations, or explicit consent for"
" biometrics, media, and marketing communication). Consent is requested per "
"purpose, separately — never bundled into one general consent — and recorded "
"with a version and timestamp."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:39
msgid ""
"Seluruh data produksi — basis data, penyimpanan objek, cadangan, dan log — "
"berada di pusat data Indonesia, tanpa replikasi lintas negara. Data "
"terenkripsi TLS 1.3 saat transit dan AES-256 saat tersimpan, dengan kunci "
"enkripsi terpisah untuk PII umum, template biometrik, dan data "
"kesehatan/konseling. Akses staf EduCore ke lingkungan produksi dibatasi "
"waktu, disetujui, dan tercatat — tidak ada kredensial produksi yang berlaku "
"permanen."
msgstr ""
"All production data — database, object storage, backups, and logs — resides "
"in Indonesian data centres, with no cross-border replication. Data is "
"encrypted with TLS 1.3 in transit and AES-256 at rest, with separate "
"encryption keys for general PII, biometric templates, and health/counselling"
" data. EduCore staff access to production is time-boxed, approved, and "
"logged — no standing production credentials exist."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:42
msgid ""
"Orang tua/wali dan staf dapat mengajukan permintaan akses, koreksi, "
"penghapusan, pembatasan pemrosesan, atau portabilitas data melalui admin "
"sekolah. Permintaan yang sah dilayani dalam 30 hari, kecuali data yang wajib"
" dipertahankan sesuai kewajiban retensi statutori (lihat"
msgstr ""
"Parents/guardians and staff can submit requests for access, correction, "
"deletion, restriction of processing, or data portability through the school "
"admin. Valid requests are served within 30 days, except for data that must "
"be retained under a statutory retention obligation (see"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:45
msgid ""
"Pengaturan berbagi data siswa secara default menggunakan opsi paling ketat. "
"Perluasan akses (misalnya berbagi data ke pihak ketiga baru) hanya dapat "
"dilakukan lewat tindakan eksplisit admin sekolah dan selalu tercatat dalam "
"jejak audit."
msgstr ""
"Student data sharing settings default to the most restrictive option. "
"Widening access (for example, sharing data with a new third party) can only "
"be done through an explicit action by the school admin, and is always "
"recorded in the audit trail."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:48
msgid ""
"Dugaan kebocoran data pribadi ditangani melalui prosedur insiden internal "
"dengan jam notifikasi 3×24 jam kepada yayasan terdampak, disertai bukti "
"kejadian dan daftar subjek data yang terpengaruh."
msgstr ""
"Suspected personal data breaches are handled through an internal incident "
"procedure with a 3×24-hour notification clock to the affected foundation, "
"including evidence of the incident and a list of affected data subjects."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/privacy_policy.html:51
msgid ""
"Pertanyaan mengenai kebijakan ini atau permintaan terkait data pribadi dapat"
" dikirim ke"
msgstr ""
"Questions about this policy or requests related to personal data can be sent"
" to"

